## Branch Summary
- `main`: Current active branch incorporating the merged typo fix (`468ed82`), synced and up to date with `origin/main`.
- `bug-fix-typo`: Dedicated branch for resolving simple interest formula typo, tracked remotely at `origin/bug-fix-typo`.
- `bug-fix-revert`: Dedicated branch for reverting typo fix commit, tracked remotely at `origin/bug-fix-revert`.
- `remotes/origin/*`: Remote tracking branches on GitHub repository `shravanishep/mcino-Introduction-to-Git-and-GitHub`.
